Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:24.52,Hook,,0,0,0,,CONDUCTOR RESPONSABLE\NEN GTA 6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:00.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:01.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Las intermitentes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:02.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Cómo se usan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.28,0:00:03.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}En teoría estoy usando las\Nintermitentes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:04.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}pero…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.62,0:00:05.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}no las veo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.34,0:00:06.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Y qué si explotaba un\Ncarro enfrente de ti?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.28,0:00:09.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ni siquiera había\Nanimación, güey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.04,0:00:11.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡F*ck!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.60,0:00:13.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Cómo explota un carro?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:14.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Adelante.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:18.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Explota esta mierda! Ya\Nveo a la policía.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:19.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Un momento.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.48,0:00:21.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Y me reportaron por\Ndisparar?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.82,0:00:22.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Hermano, esto es Estados\NUnidos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.56,0:00:24.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Es un país libre!
